{"title":"2015 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2015 AMC 12A Problems\">2015 AMC 12A #4</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10A_Problems\" title=\"2015 AMC 10A Problems\">2015 AMC 10A #6</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(CREATIVE_THINKING)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The sum of two positive numbers is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> times their difference. What is the ratio of the larger number to the smaller number?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/0/b40f4a2c56814f1e75f9159903e4f23a85f89917.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\frac{5}{4}\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ \\frac{3}{2}\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ \\frac{9}{5}\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 2 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\frac{5}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"363\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> be the bigger number and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> be the smaller.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/0/de0882ffd0f3f50f1f0c70c7a54034c1959420de.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a + b = 5(a - b)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"125\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>Multiplying out gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/2/112b9347af16f3ff0612a07a11c01942593332ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a + b = 5a - 5b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"122\" height=\"14\" /> and rearranging gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/c/28cff59e177b3903881663068ad489041cf00a12.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4a = 6b$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"60\" height=\"13\" /> and factorised into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/7/007ffe53c38f77efe73f389b2d4f54e3bc9dfe87.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2a = 3b$\" width=\"60\" height=\"12\" /> and then solving gives\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/4/b94d86254472ebd88dfb5744d38564aabeeb3145.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a}{b} = \\frac32$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"49\" height=\"37\" />, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/e/39e029b0e3735f38a496a23cab34053c4ae27649.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B) }\\frac32}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"59\" height=\"48\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Without loss of generality, let the two numbers be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, as they clearly satisfy the condition of the problem. The ratio of the larger to the smaller is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/e/39e029b0e3735f38a496a23cab34053c4ae27649.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B) }\\frac32}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"59\" height=\"48\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Test every answer choice by letting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> be the numbers in the numerator and denominator, respectively, with answer choice D being <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/f/39fcdce2fb8cf4e819f14329a7bc31865312b11e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2}{1},$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"20\" height=\"38\" /> thus only <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/e/39e029b0e3735f38a496a23cab34053c4ae27649.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B) }\\frac32}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"59\" height=\"48\" /> works.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28CREATIVE_THINKING.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(CREATIVE_THINKING)\">Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/GLfDY92_td0\">https://youtu.be/GLfDY92_td0</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/JLKoh-Nb0Os\">https://youtu.be/JLKoh-Nb0Os</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10A\" title=\"2015 AMC 10A\">2015 AMC 10A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10A_Problems\" title=\"2015 AMC 10A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2015 AMC 10A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2015 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2015 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr